OL,3,GNEWSAYellow warning for rain in place
OL,4,Aacross South East
OL,5,
OL,6,FA yellow warning for rain is in place
OL,7,Facross south-east England as the UK's
OL,8,Fsecond named storm rolls in.
OL,10,FThe Met Office warning extends until
OL,11,F23:00 BST as Storm Boelo brings more
OL,12,Fwet and windy weather, just one day
OL,13,Fafter Storm Austen hit.
OL,15,FRoads, railways, ferries and flights
OL,16,Fwere affected across Kent, Surrey and
OL,17,FSussex on Friday, and part of
OL,18,FBrighton's West Pier collapsed during
OL,19,Fhigh winds across the region.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
